         <p class="question-title">Which of these are programming languages commonly used for web development?</p>
         <p class="help-text">Tip: more than one option is correct, and some can be used on both the front end and back end.</p>
         <div class="choices">
           <div class="choice">
             <input type="checkbox" id="q1-a" name="q1" value="JavaScript">
             <label for="q1-a">JavaScript</label>
